<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Nested Tags SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B><I><U>Deeply nested formatting</U></I></B> in one line.</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><FONT COLOR="yellow"><B>Bold inside font color</B></FONT> with outer text.</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B>Outer bold <I>with inner italic</I> and back to bold</B> then normal.</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><FONT COLOR="cyan"><B><I>Triple nested: font, bold, italic</I></B></FONT></P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><I>Italic start <B>bold inside</B> italic continues</I> normal end.</P>

<SYNC Start=15000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B>Bold <FONT COLOR="red">red font inside bold</FONT> bold continues</B></P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
